{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1404","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Balanced Bitstring"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A bitstring is a string consisting only of the characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". A bitstring is called $$$k$$$-"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"balanced"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if every substring of size $$$k$$$ of this bitstring has an equal amount of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters ($$$\\frac{k}{2}$$$ of each)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$k$$$ and a string $$$s$$$ which is composed only of characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". You need to determine whether you can make a $$$k$$$-balanced bitstring by replacing every "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" characters in $$$s$$$ with either "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A string $$$a$$$ is a substring of a string $$$b$$$ if $$$a$$$ can be obtained from $$$b$$$ by deletion of several (possibly, zero or all) characters from the beginning and several (possibly, zero or all) characters from the end."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$). Description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$2 \\le k \\le n \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$k$$$ is even)  — the length of the string and the parameter for a balanced bitstring."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains the string $$$s$$$ ($$$|s| = n$$$). It is given that $$$s$$$ consists of only "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$3 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if we can replace every "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" in $$$s$$$ with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" such that the resulting bitstring is $$$k$$$-balanced, or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is not possible."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n6 4\n100110\n3 2\n1?1\n3 2\n1?0\n4 4\n????\n7 4\n1?0??1?\n10 10\n11??11??11\n4 2\n1??1\n4 4\n?0?0\n6 2\n????00\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\nNO\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first test case, the string is already a $$$4$$$-balanced bitstring."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, the string can be transformed into "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"101"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the fourth test case, the string can be transformed into "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"0110"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the fifth test case, the string can be transformed into "},{"chil